Events:<P>
<UL>
<LI> No official local events during the summer as most members are at home
or engaged in either the Spanish or Canadian Expeditions.
<LI>From: Ron Kozsan (rkozsan@net.gov.bc.ca)<BR>
July 30 - August 6 NA at Vancouver Island, BC, CANADA : **1994 Western Canadian SPELEOFEST**

When:  July 30 - August 6, 1994.
Where: Holberg, Vancouver Island, British Columbia, Canada

What:  A bunch of cavers from all over getting together to
       work-over a largely unexplored area of karst on the
       N.W. tip of Vancouver Island.

Contact: Ron Kozsan via:  rkozsan@net.gov.bc.ca
